<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Unholy Touch</h1>
<p>Sphere: Divine Sphere
Spell Tier: 2
Class: Dark Knight (guild level 34), Necromancer (guild level 80)
Mana: 20
</p><p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>cast unholy touch &lt;target&gt;
<a cmd='#'>cast unholy touch</a>   (at whoever you are fighting)
</pre>
<p>A prayer to the dark forces, made with a touch, that wounds those who lean to 
good. Any target whose alignment is above neutral can be struck, and the truly good are hurt more; on the evil 
and the neutral, nothing happens. The better your divine power and sphere, 
the more it hurts. It does about as well against any armour, and being a 
touch, a shield can block it.
</p><p>Casting it is an attack and starts a fight. It is also found on scrolls. 
Stronger prayers follow: unholy grasp and unholy shout.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
